{"id":"steam-537680","steam":537680,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Sheep Tag 2","summary":"Your friends are sheep. You are the wolf. Hunt them down as they build ridiculous farm fortresses to keep you out. Sheep Tag 2 is a Free-To-Play chaotic team-based RTS that's easy to learn and brutal to master. Play solo with bots or battle multiplayer with up to 32 players. Build. Hunt. Survive.","about":"Sheep Tag 2 is a Free-To-Play, Team-Based, Asymmetric, Real-Time Strategy Game. Sheep have to survive until the timer hits zero. Wolves have to capture every last Sheep before time runs out.\n\nYou can learn Sheep Tag 2 in a single round. Move, build, survive. The rest you'll pick up by playing. Learn against bots first with scaling difficulties who can play either side.\r\n\nIts survival, base building, resource management, MOBA-style micro, and genuine teamwork all compressed into one heart-pounding round.\n\n\r\n\r\n\nPlay as a Sheep - small, fast, and completely defenseless. Your only weapons are farms and your own skill to frantically build them. Build a fortress of farms to keep out those savage wolves.\n\nPlay as a Wolf - Stalk the map and tear down those farms to capture the sheep. Every hunt is a puzzle. Your job is to leave the Sheep with nowhere to run.\n\n\r\n\r\n\nUp to 32 players online with unique game modes and rulesets you can change on the fly. Party with friends or fill the lobby with bots.\n\nSolo players can have fun with scaling bot difficulties that play both Sheep and Wolf. Warm up alone, fill a lobby, or give yourself a challenge.\n\n\r\n\r\n\nSheep Tag came out of a map editor, so Sheep Tag 2 ships with one. A full in-game level editor, no external tools, no separate download.\n\n\r\n\r\n\nA growing community library of player-made terrains, free to browse and download. Build it, host it, share it. Design a terrain and have your friends play it the same night.\n\nSheep Tag was there before nearly everything you associate with the Warcraft 3 custom map scene. It ran for two decades on one of the most stubbornly competitive communities the mod era ever produced, and at its peak it was rivaled only by DotA.\n\nSheep Tag 2 is the standalone successor, built as a standalone indie game by someone who spent years on the other side of the screen. It's a decade of work by one of the mod's most competitive players, on a mission to take something they love and turn it into a game anyone can click and play. Every mechanic in here has been argued over, broken, and rebuilt with the help of some of the best Sheep Tag players in the world.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/537680/6e65a1ffaec5ab035725caf9a5ddcf3e5132fd1a/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794628549","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/537680/612864b180062f551733d82d7dfdd88c9813df27/header.jpg?t=1794628549","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/537680/ffd73b6f7beed050c06c3f54811d710e9822c9c9/library_hero.jpg?t=1794628549","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/537680/612864b180062f551733d82d7dfdd88c9813df27/header.jpg?t=1794628549","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/537680/3817b1e55c7164548af4cf32209ec98942a64dd0/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1794628549","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/537680/d1737a1a3ca8fcbabc6fb6c764f45f81df3841b5/ss_d1737a1a3ca8fcbabc6fb6c764f45f81df3841b5.600x338.jpg?t=1794628549","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/537680/d1737a1a3ca8fcbabc6fb6c764f45f81df3841b5/ss_d1737a1a3ca8fcbabc6fb6c764f45f81df3841b5.jpg?t=1794628549"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/537680/dd2a694ebf740bda8549d220490666d95618b2fb/ss_dd2a694ebf740bda8549d220490666d95618b2fb.600x338.jpg?t=1794628549","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta